WEBVTT

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:46.620
It can't...

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:48.210
It can't be...

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:49.540
Could it be...

00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:03.940
I made it!

00:02:25.030 --> 00:02:26.710
Is there something on your mind?

00:02:27.590 --> 00:02:29.490
Not really.

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:36.110
There are a lot of cosplay events going on these days.

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:41.180
The freshman welcome festivities are just around the corner,
so I've been wondering what I should wear.

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:44.150
If it's in the way, I'll clean it up.

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:46.460
No, that isn't necessary.

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:48.100
It's not like I have anything to do.

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:03.120
<i>You don't have to wear it! You don't have to wear it!</i>

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:05.210
<i>I just want to see how it looks.</i>

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:08.790
<i>Ogiue, cute outfits fit you
because of your large eyes.</i>

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:10.680
<i>Like this and this!</i>

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:12.130
<i>Yeah, it looks great!</i>

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:14.260
<i>Why don't you let your hair down?</i>

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:15.960
<i>You don't have to wear it, okay?</i>

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:17.090
<i>Just let your hair down.</i>

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:18.920
<i>Will you wear it if I do the same?</i>

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:19.410
<i>No...</i>

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:21.500
<i>I won't take any pictures.</i>

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:22.600
<i>I just want to see what it looks like.</i>

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:24.430
<i>Why don't you take it off?</i>

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:29.480
<i>I-I wouldn't know what to take off.</i>

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:34.170
<i>I can help you with that!</i>

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:36.570
<i>It's okay! I'll do it myself!</i>

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:53.050
Let me ask you a question based on the fact that I once cosplayed, or rather, was forced to cosplay.

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:58.220
That was because Saki-san wanted
you to come out of your shell, Ogiue-san.

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:00.590
That part is okay.

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:02.510
Well, not really.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:05.180
Aren't you embarrassed about wearing these kinds of clothes?

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:10.330
Of course it's embarrassing. That goes without saying.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:12.170
You're out in public, after all.

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:17.980
However, that's why cosplay could be
considered a means of expressing yourself.

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:19.360
That's how I feel about it.

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:22.320
I don't expect you to understand, Ogiue-san.

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:28.170
Oh, it's nothing.

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:31.380
Well, I mean...

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:38.220
The Comifes acceptance notice arrived yesterday.

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:43.410
Oh, that's good to hear.

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:45.050
Thank you.

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:50.540
That means I'll have to make a book, doesn't it?

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:52.310
Yeah.

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:56.200
I'll have to draw a manga, right?

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:57.490
Yeah.

00:04:57.490 --> 00:05:02.650
I'm really happy I won the drawing on the first try,

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:04.830
and I intend to make the book.

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:07.080
That's the whole reason I applied in the first place, but...

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:12.960
Never mind.

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:16.140
What's with that?

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:24.330
It sounds like you're trying to say that you're
embarrassed about having to draw a yaoi manga.

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:26.050
Isn't it too late for that?

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:28.810
I know it's a little too late for inhibitions.

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:33.830
You don't want to expose your own fujoshi tendencies, especially after denouncing other fujoshis as a whole.

00:05:34.610 --> 00:05:38.740
Who cares? It isn't too difficult to get over that.

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:42.200
Start cosplaying as much as you can and
get used to the embarrassing atmosphere.

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:44.660
Is cosplay your answer to everything?

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:48.990
This is why I had second thoughts about asking you, Ohno-senpai!

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:53.210
What are you talking about? You're the one who started it.

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:55.250
You asked me whether I felt embarrassed about cosplaying.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:59.480
At least I have the courage to do
these kinds of embarrassing things.

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:02.040
I'm cosplaying without shame,

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:06.140
but you haven't even drawn any yaoi manga, Ogiue-san.

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:10.050
There's a big difference between us.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.730
It's not that I haven't drawn it before.

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:20.320
Does that mean you've also written it?

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:22.110
Only a little.

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:33.690
I'd like to see it.

00:06:33.690 --> 00:06:34.490
No way.

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:35.380
But...

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:36.590
Absolutely not!

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:38.920
This is why you're no good!

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:41.990
Aren't you going to sell something at the Comifes?

00:06:41.990 --> 00:06:45.010
If not, why did you apply for it in the first place?

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:47.040
You're not making any sense. I'd like a proper explanation.

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:48.540
No means no!

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:53.010
It'd be an insult toward the God of Comifes and to
those who lost the drawing if you didn't do anything.

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:55.720
I wouldn't even be happy if you
participated with that kind of attitude.

00:06:56.170 --> 00:07:00.900
When the acceptance notice arrived, I felt more pressure than I did joy.

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:03.240
My head was spinning with uncertainty.

00:07:03.870 --> 00:07:05.440
What do you think?

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:08.560
Will you be able to draw it?

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:13.260
Will you really be able to
express your embarrassing delusions

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:15.490
in a book that the whole world will be able to see?

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:19.550
It's been the only thing on my mind.

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:20.900
I'm not sure what I should do.

00:07:21.550 --> 00:07:23.020
I see.

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:27.880
What you want to accomplish is a task
far more difficult than mine, Ogiue-san.

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:35.090
When you think about it, being able to expose your
sexual fantasies to the entire world is a pretty amazing feat.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:39.540
You don't have to phrase it like that.

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:44.830
There are lots of people who've
been doing it for a long time, though.

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:51.160
Do you consider them to be your enemies instead of your allies?

00:07:52.010 --> 00:07:54.910
What about the people who purchase those kinds of books?

00:07:54.910 --> 00:08:00.750
There might be someone who'll buy your book and think it's interesting, Ogiue-san.

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:03.730
Are those people your enemies as well?

00:08:03.730 --> 00:08:08.330
There's no way you'll get along with every single person

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:13.780
since there's bound to be a conflict of
interests or another cause for a disagreement.

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:19.060
That doesn't mean your dislike
toward everyone involved is justified.

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:24.320
Besides, are you really in a position to criticize others
when you're just as much of a fujoshi yourself, Ogiue-san?

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:28.110
That's why I hate myself, too!

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:34.870
Well, I kind of like how you've been acting lately, Ogiue-san.

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:42.310
Like when you say you hate otakus
when it's obvious that you're one yourself,

00:08:42.310 --> 00:08:45.950
and when you try to hide something and miserably fail at it.

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:48.630
I also like when you give in to pressure and reluctantly cosplay.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:54.980
Last but not least, it was really moe how you
just yelled about your embarrassing delusions.

00:08:56.210 --> 00:09:00.520
I'd like to know and talk about those delusions.

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:06.170
When the book is finished, will you show it to me?

00:09:08.090 --> 00:09:11.040
I-If I feel like it.

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:11.800
Okay.

00:09:18.250 --> 00:09:22.580
Oh, I got a little carried away with that speech.

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:24.800
Yeah.

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:26.510
My hands are trembling.

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:28.420
Now...

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:30.390
Why don't we cosplay?

00:09:30.740 --> 00:09:32.410
Why does it always have to come to that?

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:38.050
Well, I might consider trying it again in the future.

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:39.440
Really?

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:41.780
I don't want to do it at an event,

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:42.850
and only if it's among our members.

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:45.430
I did do it in the past,

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:46.440
although it was in the heat of the moment.

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:57.830
I just happen to have a costume made by
Tanaka-san that would fit you perfectly, Ogiue-san!

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:00.460
<i>She caught me off-guard!</i>

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:04.630
Why not? It'll look wonderful.

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:05.680
It's locked.

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:07.290
I'll open it right away!

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:08.130
What?

00:10:08.990 --> 00:10:11.090
No, don't!

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:13.480
Sasahara-san's a member, isn't he?

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:16.620
These circumstances aren't acceptable!

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:19.920
Should I come back later?

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:20.090
Oh, I'll be there in a second.

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:21.770
Please do!

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:25.310
Oh, Ogiue-san, the clothes you just
took off
are still where you left them.

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:26.020
No!

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:28.000
<i>Clothes she just took off...</i>

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:31.380
Come in.

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:33.410
Is it okay if I come inside?

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:35.410
Step right in.

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:47.400
Why the cosplay?

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:50.200
Ogiue-san won the Comifes drawing,

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:52.220
Oh, you were accepted after all.

00:10:52.220 --> 00:10:56.850
and she personally said she'd like to
commemorate the event by cosplaying.

00:10:56.850 --> 00:10:58.170
That's not true!

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:00.530
What do you think, Sasahara-san?

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:02.600
Well, I'm at a loss for words.

00:11:03.110 --> 00:11:05.590
Well, isn't it cute?

00:11:05.590 --> 00:11:07.350
Isn't it?

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:10.790
Ogiue-san, how does it feel to be complimented?

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:15.920
Come on. Put those clothes down and stand up straight.

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:18.240
The chest line for this costume is what makes it cute.

00:11:18.580 --> 00:11:21.660
Isn't that from Elemental Butler?

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:24.620
Yes, yes. It's Aerial-tan.

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:27.700
Now, Ogiue-san. Come on.

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:32.920
Oh, she ran away.

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:47.520
Oh, she came back.

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:48.530
Is this a sign of her maturity?

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:51.900
She just didn't want to run outside.

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:57.980
Good.

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:04.870
Please make sure to mention cosplaying on the poster.

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:09.840
Wouldn't it be faster if we used Youko-san's picture?

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:13.830
Give me a break. Youko is my cosplay persona.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:16.790
Right now, I'm Ohno Kanako, president of Genshiken.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:19.680
<i>She doesn't understand what I'm trying to say.</i>

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:31.890
This is nice, isn't it?

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:33.280
Please don't touch anything.

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:39.360
Wow, a cosplay!

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:42.190
Please feel free to look.

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:44.950
Wow, amazing!
Are all of these handmade?

00:12:45.350 --> 00:12:48.340
Yes, but the person who made these is now an alumnus.

00:12:48.340 --> 00:12:52.630
It's really detailed. You can have yours custom-made, too.

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:54.770
Wow, really?

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:54.870
How cool. I should order one for myself.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:58.290
<i>It might really become a cosplay research club,</i>

00:12:58.310 --> 00:12:59.590
<i>not that I mind if it does.</i>

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:03.340
Oh, how nostalgic.

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:06.040
The magical pâtissier, Sweet Chocolat!

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:07.680
Do you like it?

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:10.660
Well, kind of...

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:13.830
Really? I see.

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:15.780
I hate it, though.

00:13:16.780 --> 00:13:18.620
What else? What else?

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:21.410
Um, Samurai Warriors?

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:24.170
Yes! You are best answer!

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:25.360
You are an aficionado!

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:28.100
Um, thanks a lot!

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:29.380
We have to get going.

00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:30.290
Bye.

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:32.340
Leaving so soon?

00:13:32.340 --> 00:13:33.940
Thanks a lot!

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:39.780
Kuchiki-kun!

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:43.720
This is an order from the president. Go back to the club room.

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:46.970
Your conduct at this welcoming event is creating
a sense of uneasiness among prospective recruits,

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:48.550
which is causing them to shun our club.

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:50.680
That is completely unacceptable.

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:55.480
These kinds of incidents should be
considered on a case by case basis...

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:58.270
Yes, case by case, alright?

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:02.340
Lies and flattery are, you know, like truth and doubt.

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:04.900
Right, style and morals...

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:06.070
Go at once!

00:14:12.570 --> 00:14:15.030
Was I that weird?

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:18.560
I was only trying to be friendly.

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:24.780
Oh, Ogichin, you're all alone.

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:27.060
<i>D-Did she click her tongue?</i>

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:39.860
<i>She clicked her tongue.
Wow, she's serious.</i>

00:14:39.860 --> 00:14:46.610
<i>Well, I knew she disliked me,
but I didn't think she'd be so blatant about it.</i>

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:51.750
<i>Is this considered a new discovery or is it confirmation?</i>

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:52.620
Did something happen?

00:14:53.090 --> 00:14:57.300
"Kuchiki-senpai's the only one in
there, so you probably shouldn't go,"

00:14:57.300 --> 00:14:58.380
or so I was told.

00:15:00.270 --> 00:15:05.460
Listen to my story! Kucchii feels so vexed and sad!

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:07.630
No, I really don't want to hear about it.

00:15:10.500 --> 00:15:13.530
Wasn't Kuchiki-kun on his way over there?

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:15.470
That's why I left the room.

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:19.080
It's impossible to be alone with that person.

00:15:20.470 --> 00:15:22.270
Did you finish the poster?

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:24.820
Not yet, since I left when Kuchiki-senpai came in.

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:28.020
I suppose it can't be helped.

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:29.310
I'm sorry.

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:31.470
Should I pass out the flyers?

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:33.300
Yes, please do.

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:37.080
You don't have to treat Kuchiki-kun like tha...

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:38.520
Forget it!

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:41.920
Well, there's nothing you can do about it.

00:15:42.430 --> 00:15:43.880
You're pretty weird, Kucchii.

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:46.810
Do you think so?

00:15:47.530 --> 00:15:51.520
Well, you did hit Ogiue.

00:15:55.360 --> 00:15:57.480
You also took that secret photo.

00:15:57.480 --> 00:16:01.920
It's Ogichin at the Scrum Dunk event.

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:07.450
Take this!

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:12.390
Why do you do those kinds of things?

00:16:12.390 --> 00:16:15.660
I realize what you're saying, but I can't help it.

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:18.310
If you were a comedian,
you'd be an enigmatic act.

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:20.940
You're the type who would ignore
broadcast regulations and go out of control.

00:16:21.300 --> 00:16:24.590
It's true he's hard to deal with.

00:16:24.590 --> 00:16:28.220
Don't you think someone like him fits our image, though?

00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:34.980
That may be true,
but I'm not in a position to comment on others.

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:39.020
Neither is an indecisive guy like me.

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:43.980
Try to treat him like a normal person.

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:48.330
Normal, huh? If you say so, Sasahara-san.

00:16:49.260 --> 00:16:53.900
You make it sound like he's public enemy number one.

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:57.520
<i>Why don't you go one more time?
Just act normal.</i>

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:04.840
<i>I should probably go back.</i>

00:17:05.280 --> 00:17:06.700
Oh, Kuchiki-kun.

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:09.340
I was looking for you.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:14.560
Don't try to run away.

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:20.720
Well, whatever.

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:21.650
Yeah.

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:22.980
Okay.

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:28.560
Oh, the hanger is out of place.

00:17:32.550 --> 00:17:34.200
You don't have to touch it!

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:37.250
Should I hand out the flyers?

00:17:37.250 --> 00:17:40.080
Nobody would take it from you, Kuchiki-senpai.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:42.350
Come on, take a seat.

00:17:42.350 --> 00:17:43.780
There's some manga here.

00:17:43.780 --> 00:17:46.040
Am I in elementary school or something?

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:48.630
I'm going to the bathroom.

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:50.070
Hold down the fort while I'm gone.

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:52.200
Okay.

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:57.430
Yes, isn't the ceremony version great?

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:02.810
Please take one.

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:17.760
<i>A guy?</i>

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:20.220
<i>Suspicious... He looks suspicious!</i>

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:23.000
<i>My sensors are going haywire!</i>

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:25.780
I think the arrangements can be made immediately.

00:18:25.780 --> 00:18:28.630
He started attending a vocational school after he graduated.

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:31.070
Please take one. Please take one.

00:18:32.780 --> 00:18:34.760
<i>They haven't realized it yet.</i>

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:38.080
<i>Is he a voyeur or a thief?</i>

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:40.420
<i>There's no doubt he's one of the two.</i>

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:43.780
<i>Ohno-senpai is wearing a miniskirt,
and there are a lot of costumes to look after.</i>

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:46.840
<i>W-W-W-What should I do?</i>

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:49.600
<i>Should I stand next to him and act as a deterrent</i>

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:52.070
<i>or should I wait for senpai to come back?</i>

00:18:57.580 --> 00:18:59.690
<i>He put it in his bag!</i>

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.210
<i>Oh, shit.</i>

00:19:07.170 --> 00:19:09.060
Excuse me.

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:12.880
Do you mind if I check the contents of your bag, please?

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:14.960
Who the hell are you?

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:18.050
You don't have to ask me like that, do you?

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:19.810
I'm asking you to show me
what's in your bag.

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:23.370
That's none of your business.

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:25.340
Who gave you the right to do that?

00:19:25.340 --> 00:19:28.280
It's not a matter of rights.

00:19:28.280 --> 00:19:30.570
Show me your bag, nya.

00:19:30.570 --> 00:19:34.190
Wow, what an idiot. This conversation is a waste of my time.

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:35.110
Get out of the way!

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:38.360
Oh, losing your temper, huh?
That's fine with me!

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:41.620
When it comes to going ballistic,
I've never lost to anyone!

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:43.760
What are you talking about?

00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:00.600
<i>Damn, he's fast.</i>

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:02.700
<i>At least I remember what he looked like...</i>

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:07.850
<i>I hardly remember anything about him.</i>

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:09.650
Yes?

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:13.930
Why are you holding on to that so tightly?

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:20.220
I wonder if Kucchii's getting along with everyone else.

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:21.490
Probably not.

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:23.250
He's a lost cause.

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:29.760
Well, I know this looks suspicious, I'll admit that. I'll admit that,

00:20:29.760 --> 00:20:32.760
but there's a good reason for this.

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:36.980
Give it back to me! Give it back right now!

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:39.880
It'll get dirty!

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:48.310
Take it off! Take it off! Take it off!

00:20:52.340 --> 00:20:54.290
What's going on?

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:55.360
I don't know.

00:20:56.650 --> 00:21:01.100
I'll annihilate everything on behalf of the moon!

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:04.620
Stop him!

00:22:40.420 --> 00:22:43.180
It didn't seem like he was from our campus.

00:22:43.180 --> 00:22:45.330
Oh, the costume thief?

00:22:45.700 --> 00:22:47.920
I'm a little scared.

00:22:48.320 --> 00:22:50.400
What's the world coming to?

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:54.030
Well, we'll file this under the Kucchii hero arc.

00:22:54.360 --> 00:22:59.840
I'm grateful for what he did,
and I'm also sorry for jumping to conclusions, but...

00:22:59.840 --> 00:23:03.000
The number of new members came out to zero, huh?

00:23:04.960 --> 00:23:06.980
Oh, is the president in a state of shock?

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:09.930
Not really.

00:23:11.230 --> 00:23:13.500
What does it mean when people say,
"She's my wife"?

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:14.880
I-In what context?

00:23:14.880 --> 00:23:21.030
People who say their favorite manga or game characters are moe use them as an object of their perverted fantasies, right?

00:23:21.030 --> 00:23:22.780
Don't try to make me agree.

00:23:22.780 --> 00:23:29.130
Is it okay for other otakus to share those very fantasies?

00:23:29.130 --> 00:23:29.860
Is that acceptable?

00:23:29.860 --> 00:23:31.560
Well, that's...

00:23:31.560 --> 00:23:36.300
Is it possible that otakus are in favor of
polyandry, sharing one wife among many husbands?

00:23:36.860 --> 00:23:38.550
Give me a break.
